<form version="1.1" theme="dark" script="dei_lifecycle_store_v1.js,dei_detection_standards_v1.js,detection_query_generator_v2.js,dei_environment_scan_v1.js,dei_workspace_layout_v1.js" stylesheet="command_center_v2.css,dei_visual_polish_v1.css,detection_lifecycle_v1.css,dei_workspace_layout_v1.css">
  <label>Detection Builder</label>
  <description>Generate reviewable platform SPL and Enterprise Security detection drafts from qualified telemetry.</description>
  <fieldset submitButton="false" autoRun="false"></fieldset>
  <row>
    <panel>
      <html>
        <div id="dei-detection-builder-page" class="dei-shell dei-lifecycle-page dei-builder-page">
          <section class="dei-product-bar" aria-label="DEI workspace navigation">
            <div class="dei-product-brand"><span class="dei-brand-mark">DEI</span><div><strong>Detection Engineering Intelligence</strong><span>Detection Builder</span></div></div>
            <nav class="dei-workspace-nav"><a href="dei_home">Home</a><a href="command_center">Environment</a><a href="mitre_coverage">MITRE ATT&amp;CK</a><a class="active" href="detection_builder">Builder</a><a href="detection_lifecycle">Lifecycle</a></nav>
            <label class="dei-lifecycle-workspace-menu"><span>Lifecycle workspace</span><select id="lifecycle-workspace-menu"><option value="detection_lifecycle">Lifecycle Overview</option><option value="detection_builder" selected="selected">Detection Builder</option></select></label>
          </section>

          <section class="dei-builder-hero">
            <div><p class="dei-eyebrow">Detection Engineering Action Workspace</p><h1>Build, review, and export detection artifacts.</h1><p>This dedicated workspace preserves room for query refinement, ATT&amp;CK context, validation evidence, ES parameters, testing, and future approval actions.</p></div>
            <a class="dei-builder-back" href="detection_lifecycle">← Return to Lifecycle Overview</a>
          </section>

          <section class="dei-lifecycle-section dei-builder-selector-section">
            <div class="dei-lifecycle-section-head"><div><p class="dei-eyebrow">Qualified Recommendation</p><h2>Select a detection to build</h2><p>Telemetry-ready recommendations and engineering candidates with verified gaps are available. Incomplete candidates are clearly flagged and remain drafts until prerequisites are resolved.</p></div><span id="builder-ready-count" class="dei-chip">0 ready</span></div>
            <div class="dei-builder-selector"><select id="builder-detection-select" aria-label="Telemetry-ready detection"><option value="">Select a detection to build</option></select><button id="builder-generate" type="button" disabled="disabled">Generate detection draft</button></div>
          </section>

          <section id="detection-generator" class="dei-lifecycle-section dei-generator-section">
            <div class="dei-lifecycle-section-head"><div><p class="dei-eyebrow">Detection Query Builder</p><h2>Reviewable platform and ES artifacts</h2><p>Generate telemetry-scoped SPL, ATT&amp;CK mappings, a recommended cron schedule, and—when Enterprise Security is enabled—a disabled correlation-search draft with finding/notable and RBA parameters.</p></div><span id="generator-es-state" class="dei-lifecycle-contract">Select a telemetry-ready detection</span></div>
            <div id="generator-empty" class="dei-generator-empty">Select a recommendation above to begin. Unsupported detections and recommendations without observed telemetry remain blocked.</div>
            <div id="generator-output" class="dei-generator-output" style="display:none">
              <div class="dei-generator-heading"><div><h3 id="generator-title">Detection draft</h3><div id="generator-badges" class="dei-generator-badges"></div></div><div class="dei-generator-actions"><button id="builder-save-draft" type="button">Save draft</button><button id="builder-reset-draft" type="button">Reset generated values</button><button id="copy-generated-spl" type="button">Copy SPL</button><button id="copy-generated-json" type="button">Copy definition</button><button id="download-generated-json" type="button">Download JSON</button></div></div>
              <div id="builder-feedback" class="dei-builder-feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite">Generated draft is ready for review.</div>
              <div class="dei-builder-editor-meta">
                <label><span>Cron schedule</span><input id="builder-cron" type="text" spellcheck="false" /></label>
                <label><span>Earliest time</span><input id="builder-earliest" type="text" spellcheck="false" /></label>
                <label><span>Latest time</span><input id="builder-latest" type="text" spellcheck="false" /></label>
              </div>
              <div class="dei-generator-grid">
                <article><label class="dei-generator-label" for="generator-spl">Detection SPL</label><textarea id="generator-spl" spellcheck="false" aria-describedby="builder-validation-help"></textarea><small id="builder-validation-help">Validation runs this SPL as an authenticated, bounded historical search and returns at most 25 result rows.</small></article>
                <article><span class="dei-generator-label">Enterprise Security configuration</span><div id="generator-es-output"></div></article>
              </div>
              <section id="builder-quality-workspace" class="dei-quality-workspace" aria-labelledby="builder-quality-title">
                <div class="dei-quality-heading"><div><span class="dei-generator-label">Detection engineering standards</span><h3 id="builder-quality-title">SPL quality and production readiness</h3><p>Required checks cover correctness, telemetry scope, performance, scheduling, analyst context, MITRE mapping, and Enterprise Security readiness.</p></div><div><strong id="builder-quality-score">0%</strong><span id="builder-quality-state" data-state="blocked">Generate a draft</span></div></div>
                <div id="builder-quality-dimensions" class="dei-quality-dimensions"></div>
                <div id="builder-quality-issues" class="dei-quality-issues"><p>Generate a draft to evaluate its engineering quality.</p></div>
              </section>
              <section class="dei-validation-workspace" aria-labelledby="builder-validation-title">
                <div class="dei-validation-heading"><div><span class="dei-generator-label">Historical validation</span><h3 id="builder-validation-title">Test against Splunk telemetry</h3><p>Runs only the selected draft, applies a hard result cap, and records evidence in the shared lifecycle record.</p></div><button id="builder-run-validation" type="button">Run validation</button></div>
                <div id="builder-validation-state" class="dei-validation-state idle">Not run</div>
                <div id="builder-validation-metrics" class="dei-validation-metrics" style="display:none"><div><span>Status</span><strong id="validation-status">—</strong></div><div><span>Results</span><strong id="validation-result-count">0</strong></div><div><span>Runtime</span><strong id="validation-runtime">—</strong></div><div><span>Validated</span><strong id="validation-time">—</strong></div></div>
                <section id="builder-validation-resolution" class="dei-validation-resolution" hidden="hidden" aria-labelledby="builder-validation-resolution-title">
                  <div class="dei-validation-resolution-head"><div><span>Validation resolution</span><h4 id="builder-validation-resolution-title">Correct the failed search</h4></div><span id="builder-validation-resolution-category">Review required</span></div>
                  <p id="builder-validation-resolution-summary"></p>
                  <pre id="builder-validation-error"></pre>
                  <ol id="builder-validation-resolution-steps"></ol>
                  <div class="dei-validation-resolution-actions"><button id="builder-apply-validation-fix" type="button">Apply recommended fix</button><button id="builder-edit-validation-query" type="button">Edit detection SPL</button><button id="builder-retry-validation" type="button">Run validation again</button></div>
                </section>
                <div id="builder-validation-results" class="dei-validation-results" style="display:none"><table><thead id="validation-result-head"></thead><tbody id="validation-result-body"></tbody></table></div>
              </section>
              <p class="dei-generator-safety">Drafts and validation evidence are persisted in the shared DEI lifecycle store. DEI does not enable or deploy detections without analyst review.</p>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="dei-lifecycle-capabilities" aria-label="Detection engineering capabilities">
            <article class="implemented"><span>Implemented</span><h3>Telemetry intelligence</h3><p>Discovery, normalization, representative field profiling, evidence-based readiness, and MITRE mapping.</p></article>
            <article class="foundation"><span>Foundation</span><h3>Open Detection Definition</h3><p>Canonical schema exists for logic, requirements, templates, mappings, validation, and safe content handling.</p></article>
            <article class="next"><span>Next capability</span><h3>SPL generation and validation</h3><p>Render versioned searches, resolve field mappings, execute bounded historical tests, and preserve evidence.</p></article>
            <article class="future"><span>Lifecycle expansion</span><h3>Review, deploy, monitor, tune</h3><p>Persist lifecycle records and add optional ES content, RBA, finding, health, and utilization integrations.</p></article>
          </section>
        </div>
      </html>
    </panel>
  </row>
</form>

